    "transcript": "Use the paper ticket to understand a trade before submitting anything. Open Trade and check the instrument. Choose a direction, confirm the order type, and enter an example lot size. Enable Stop Loss and enter the level from your exercise. Add a Take Profit level too. Now pause on the loss and margin estimates. Reduce the lot size and notice what changes. These are simulation estimates, not guaranteed limits or your broker's exact figures. Recheck the direction, size, stop and target. This tutorial ends with a prepared ticket. We have not submitted an order.",
    "audio": "Arthur narration"
  },
