    "transcript": "The Scanner points to patterns to examine, not instructions to trade. Check your market and timeframe, then open Scanner. Choose one result and read its name and direction. Its score is a heuristic review cue; it is not a measured chance of winning or Oracle's nine-check percentage. Turn on Patterns to see an available overlay and compare it with the candles. Look for something that could contradict the idea, as well as something that supports it. If the picture is unclear, wait. Bring the example to your instructor instead of forcing a trade.",
    "audio": "Arthur narration"
  },
