    "transcript": "ARIA helps you inspect the conditions behind a setup. Start by checking the market and timeframe. Open ARIA and read the market conditions before the score. Each passed gate means one of its rules matched; each failed gate is something to examine. Read the verdict and any restriction. A large number of matching checks does not cancel a restriction or predict a profitable trade. Ask what evidence would invalidate the idea. In this example, the restriction means we wait and leave the ticket alone. Explain that decision in your lesson notes or ask your instructor about the check you do not understand.",
    "audio": "Arthur narration"
  },
